                         562 --320: * Function name: mm_FLS_PreCheck
                         563 --321: * Description  : Prepare check of flash operation(except read operation)
                         564 --322: * Arguments    :  (in) uint8_t  target_flash : target flash memory
                         565 --323: *                 (in) uint8_t  target_area  : type of target flash memory
                         566 --324: *                 (in) uint8_t  ds_type      : type of data-set
                         567 --325: *                 (in) uint16_t size         : sizeof target data-set
                         568 --326: *                 (in) uint8_t  operation    : operation of flash memory
