                       28464 --4614: * Description  : FLS Compare Value (with wrap-around measures).
                       28465 --4615: * Arguments    : value1: Compare target value 1
                       28466 --4616: *                value2: Compare target value 2
                       28467 --4617: *                max_value: If the difference between value1 and value2 is greater than this value,
                       28468 --4618: *                           it is judged that wrap-around occurs
                       28469 --4619: * Return Value : FLS_CMP_SMALL : value1 < value2
