                       32075 --2746: * Function name: mm_FLS_GetGCState
                       32076 --2747: * Description  : Get flash GC state (for MM_FLS_CollectGarbage)
                       32077 --2748: * Arguments    : (in)  r_icumif_job_id_t job_id  : job id
                       32078 --2749: *                (out) uint32_t* p_source_block  : GC source block number
                       32079 --2750: *                (out) uint32_t* p_reserve_block : GC reserve block number
                       32080 --2751: * Return Value : ER_OK
                       32081 --2752: *                ER_PARAM
