                       44622 --4618: *                           it is judged that wrap-around occurs
                       44623 --4619: * Return Value : FLS_CMP_SMALL : value1 < value2
                       44624 --4620: *                FLS_CMP_EQUAL : value1 = value2
                       44625 --4621: *                FLS_CMP_LARGE : value1 > value2
